+3. **Recovery:** If the coordinate differences between $c_i$ and $c_{i+1}$ indicate the ray passed through a shared corner or edge (e.g., both non-driving axes change simultaneously), identify and insert the missing intermediate cell(s) into the traversal sequence [S1].
+4. **Completion:** Append the final cell and return the complete sequence [S1].
